Third-party software and data (NOT covered by this license)

This repository does not contain Gnomix, its pretrained models, Beagle or any
genotype data. The pipeline downloads them at run time:

- Gnomix (https://github.com/AI-sandbox/gnomix) and its pretrained models are
  "available free of charge for academic research use only". Commercial use
  requires a license from Galatea Bio / Stanford OTL. The same terms apply to
  results you produce with them.
- Beagle 5.5 (B. L. Browning) is distributed under the GNU GPL v3.
- 1000 Genomes data (IGSR) are open access. The PLINK 2 conversions are from
  https://www.cog-genomics.org/plink/2.0/resources.
